their own opinion."}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Everyone has their own opinion."}]}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":3},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"১২.২ Banglish ও দক্ষিণ এশীয় ইংরেজি"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"এগুলো বাংলাদেশে সম্পূর্ণ স্বাভাবিক শোনায়, কিন্তু আন্তর্জাতিক ইংরেজিতে ভুল বা বোধগম্য নয়। Examiner (প্রায়ই ব্রিটিশ বা অস্ট্রেলীয়) এগুলো ধরে ফেলেন।"}]},{"type":"table","content":[{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"❌ যা বলা হয়"}]}]},{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"✅ যা বলা উচিত"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Myself Misbah."}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"My name is Misbah. / I''m Misbah."}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Maximum people think..."}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Most people think..."}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Day by day it is increasing."}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"It''s increasing steadily / year by year."}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I am doing job in a bank."}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I work at a bank. / I have a job at a bank."}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"My cousin brother / cousin sister"}]}]},{"type":"t